{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0114_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1dec516a347aaf14fd914b2543782856d8f060e5e1c2821450917bb66c9f667e", "ja": "（今度の仕事は、テーマパークのフラワーパレード。\n朋花はスタッフさんに、花のリクエストを聞かれた）", "zh": "（这次的工作是参加主题乐园的百花游行。\n工作人员向朋花寻问她想用哪一种花当装饰。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0114_1001_p", "source_sha256": "cf6a765affea09c64ae8ff5348dc22104be9be566ee84665b1c5acf15e2c4b6a", "ja": "朋花、ブログ見たよ。パレードのフロートに飾る花、\n子豚ちゃん達にアンケートを取ったんだな？", "zh": "朋花，我看过部落格啰。\n你有向小猪们调查要用哪种花装饰游行花车，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0114_1002_031tom", "source_sha256": "948673e089a8064529ed355d563d9bb2279f9a0f4f673f340db140087375515d", "ja": "ええ。私が乗るフロートに相応しいお花は、\n子豚ちゃん達に聞くのが一番だと思いまして～。", "zh": "是的，哪一种花最适合装饰我搭乘的花车，\n我觉得直接问小猪们是最恰当的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0114_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a1275c031bba181459247261adf271d2de798e6410e0b845a0f66d3288971c07", "ja": "確かに、朋花に似合う花なら、\nファンである子豚ちゃん達に聞くのが一番だな。", "zh": "说得对，既然是要问适合朋花的花，\n身为粉丝的小猪们当然是不二人选。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0114_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "aff707e0bd4138e163ba7cdc785f078ac4a935d71d37ebe97977ddfeffebaceb", "ja": "あら……{$P$}さん～？\n言うことは、それだけですか～？", "zh": "哎呀……{$P$}先生～？\n你的感想就这样而已吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0114_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "f62d60df1920e7c62d09c37c4822123ad0e8ace2bc2f8388fd9c77ae3bfdef3a", "ja": "だとしたら、肝心なことがわかっていません～。\nダメプロデューサーですね～。", "zh": "这就表示你不懂其中关键～\n真是无能的制作人呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0114_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a65684aa5b0aeed0edfe00ba30e0460e92907b6ea05305e7b227c93ed539ec2f", "ja": "え？　何か、おかしな事を言ったかな……。", "zh": "咦？我说错话了吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0114_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "fd16e797b2bbc6e81c608a79df765e3a7adab6d27008224225031eabaa5e96dc", "ja": "それでは、特別にヒントを差し上げますよ～。\nヒントは、この衣装です～。", "zh": "那么，我就破例给你提示吧～\n提示就是这套服装～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0114_1008_p", "source_sha256": "5630b7097368978dda0d4bdabbe4fba3aa5fc565d242996c494cf19aadd7e065", "ja": "それは、パレードに合わせて作った新しい衣装だな。\n衣装がどうかしたのか……？", "zh": "这是配合游行制作的新服装吧。\n这套服装怎么了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0114_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "0a5cda8d3efe1140e2e81224a9cbf6499b0c786b36d861f98b928cf7486fb002", "ja": "まだわからないのですか～？　仕方がありませんね～。\nでは、最後のヒントですよ～。", "zh": "你还不懂吗～？真拿你没办法～\n那么，这是最后的提示啰～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0114_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "41f6ee4d236b1bb877f0fc8c9b1d03a5f08405d7f358c2b34fd0d0d8bf78b03b", "ja": "ブログに衣装の写真を載せたのは、\n何故だと思いますか～？", "zh": "你认为我把服装照片放到部落格上\n是为了什么呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0114_1011_p", "source_sha256": "76232c9cf8f5efcb56dc9997570ade0430ae615ccd0695cfd1faedbd47642ea0", "ja": "え～と……あ、そうか！\nこの衣装に合う花を、選んでもらったって事か！", "zh": "呃……啊，我懂了！\n是要让他们挑选适合这套服装的花吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0114_1012_031tom", "source_sha256": "ab3b91d72ac32222683742303179b57bc65895506b3def15f9b885ee899ca748", "ja": "うふふ。鈍感な{$P$}さんにも、\nやっとわかったようですね～？", "zh": "呵呵，迟钝的{$P$}先生\n似乎总算明白了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0114_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "3c85b53fd8336316b74fb223d347a0010b7ab1ecba8ccd608635ec477183159c", "ja": "{$P$}さんが私のために\nあつらえた、特別な衣装を着て……。", "zh": "穿着{$P$}先生为我订制的\n特别服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0114_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "5b74e4a5f7d0a65e5d6f02bc2b79372c777c781568df49e32195368cd8105f8b", "ja": "その衣装に合うようにと、子豚ちゃん達が選んだ\nお花のフロートに乗る……。", "zh": "由小猪们挑选出适合这套服装的花，\n我再站在用那种花装饰的花车上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0114_1015_031tom", "source_sha256": "100a89d3cfbebd36e4a4c7d6b6900f73bd91814ad23673ed8249ca4095181531", "ja": "聖母のパレードに、これほど相応しい物は\nないと思っていたのですが～？", "zh": "我觉得这是最符合圣母游行的做法～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0114_1016_p", "source_sha256": "567643549a28c90fd5f2e5f202a18c17670203ec59ddeb9dc8319d718664d4bf", "ja": "そうか……衣装の事も、大切に考えてくれてたんだな。\n気がつかなくて、悪かった。", "zh": "这样啊……你连服装都用心考虑进去了。\n对不起，没有察觉到你的用心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0114_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "a28d609634e7d2408599824207c8b772f91e8102112b9a2334f1cb86fc4289cc", "ja": "では今回のことは、この素敵な衣装に免じて\n許してあげましょう～。", "zh": "那么，这次就看在这套美丽服装的份上\n原谅你吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0114_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "0a34c2305280f59f076260dbc8f424633b8c6d7e586880b3265d13d9529bd515", "ja": "その代わり……今度は、私が何を言いたいか、\nヒントがなくてもわかりますよね～？", "zh": "相对的……下次不用提示，\n你应该也明白我想说什么吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0114_1019_p", "source_sha256": "e7243f9a199f5c0f8e31dd4c141b82b0b1ebac6d43d7101a6b471554f2ecb9b0", "ja": "ああ。朋花の気持ちが子豚ちゃん達に伝わるように、\nしっかりプロデュースするよ！", "zh": "嗯，我会好好培育朋花，\n让你的心意能传达给小猪们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0114_1020_031tom", "source_sha256": "13f5f4da1943bb74e6839845f67b14d61a7160de6d62e3a9cdcb743822a647cc", "ja": "うふふ、よくできました～。\n期待していますよ、{$P$}さん～。", "zh": "呵呵，说得很好～\n我很期待喔，{$P$}先生～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
